<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13087" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dēni</span></b> , ae, a (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>gen. plur.</i>, denum, <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2,
				2, 49 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 2,
				10, 26 al.</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">denorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					43, 5 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			), <i>num. distrib.</i> [decem], <i>ten each, ten at a time, by tens</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">uxores habent deni duodenique inter se
					communes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. G. 5, 14</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ariovistus denos ut ad colloquium adducerent
					postulavit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 43, 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, for decem, <i>ten</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bis denis Phrygium conscendi navibus aequor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 1, 381</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">11, 326</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ter denis navibus ibant,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 10, 213</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ut bis dena viginti non sint,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 2, 7, 5, § 27 al.</span></i>
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> For
			decimus, <i>tenth</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dena Luna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. Her. 11, 46</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
